      "text": "就是假设他这个里面有一有某些实实质的东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 368520,
      "end_ms": 369480,
      "text": "就跟洋葱嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 369480,
      "end_ms": 371010,
      "text": "这个洋葱不停的往里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 371010,
      "end_ms": 372270,
      "text": "不停的往里面泄"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 372270,
      "end_ms": 373660,
      "text": "不停往里面吸"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 375040,
      "end_ms": 378060,
      "text": "这种不停的往里面陷入这种洋葱结构"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 378060,
      "end_ms": 380400,
      "text": "它实际上一直有的就是这个内在性的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 380400,
      "end_ms": 384230,
      "text": "这个它实际上这里面什么都没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 384230,
      "end_ms": 386340,
      "text": "纯有的就是一个内在性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 387440,
      "end_ms": 390520,
      "text": "其他的那个每一层都是通过这个内在性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "start_ms": 390520,
      "end_ms": 391540,
      "text": "附属到里面去的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 133,
      "start_ms": 391540,
      "end_ms": 392440,
      "text": "那么这个内在性是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
      "start_ms": 392440,
      "end_ms": 393880,
      "text": "就是你的自我意识"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 135,
      "start_ms": 396620,
      "end_ms": 400570,
      "text": "就是你自我意识你的你的那种过剩的自由"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 136,
      "start_ms": 400570,
      "end_ms": 405220,
      "text": "过剩的不能说自由了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 137,
      "start_ms": 405220,
      "end_ms": 406810,
      "text": "应该叫过剩的自恋"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 138,
      "start_ms": 406810,
      "end_ms": 408010,
      "text": "过剩的自恋"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 139,
      "start_ms": 408010,
      "end_ms": 410100,
      "text": "他其实就是你过剩的自恋"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 140,
      "start_ms": 410200,
      "end_ms": 412180,
      "text": "每一次进行表象的消解"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 141,
      "start_ms": 412180,
      "end_ms": 415000,
      "text": "后面总要有一个新的表象来满足你的自恋"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 142,
      "start_ms": 415000,
      "end_ms": 417020,
      "text": "看我还很强"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 143,
      "start_ms": 417020,
      "end_ms": 420340,
      "text": "我可以给它赋赋予一个新的表象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 144,
      "start_ms": 420340,
      "end_ms": 424040,
      "text": "而且这种这下面又是什么什么东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 145,
      "start_ms": 424040,
      "end_ms": 425180,
      "text": "又是什么什么东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 146,
      "start_ms": 425180,
      "end_ms": 429200,
      "text": "这种东西炫技就是就是那些后现代知识分子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 147,
      "start_ms": 429200,
      "end_ms": 431940,
      "text": "他是大部分是受过良好的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 148,
      "start_ms": 431940,
      "end_ms": 435720,
      "text": "这个古典学和现代潮流美学教育的这种人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 149,
      "start_ms": 435720,
      "end_ms": 436710,
      "text": "他是炫技"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 150,
      "start_ms": 436710,
      "end_ms": 438699,
      "text": "凡尔赛学啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 151,
      "start_ms": 438699,
      "end_ms": 440739,
      "text": "这凡尔赛赛学啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 152,
      "start_ms": 440739,
      "end_ms": 445820,
      "text": "他这种凡凡尔赛哲学是不是炫耀他知识量"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 153,
      "start_ms": 445820,
      "end_ms": 447260,
      "text": "你知道吗啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 154,
      "start_ms": 447260,
      "end_ms": 449600,
      "text": "他并不想说明什么问题"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 155,
      "start_ms": 449600,
      "end_ms": 452949,
      "text": "他因为他不懂得研究里面的具体结构之间"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 156,
      "start_ms": 452949,
      "end_ms": 453789,
      "text": "内在有什么矛盾"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 157,
      "start_ms": 453789,
      "end_ms": 454509,
      "text": "他不会呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 158,
      "start_ms": 454509,
      "end_ms": 455709,
      "text": "这家伙哪会嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 159,
      "start_ms": 455709,
      "end_ms": 459160,
      "text": "他只找到相互之间有那种共通性就开始玩了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 160,
      "start_ms": 459160,
      "end_ms": 460210,
      "text": "他根本没有把握"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 161,
      "start_ms": 460210,
      "end_ms": 462040,
      "text": "他连这个相互之间的差异"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 162,
      "start_ms": 462040,
      "end_ms": 463000,
      "text": "真正意义上差异"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 163,
      "start_ms": 463000,
      "end_ms": 465880,
      "text": "他的没有能力去把握这样本质主义者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 164,
      "start_ms": 465880,
      "end_ms": 467140,
      "text": "这样的所谓的后现代"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 165,
      "start_ms": 467140,
      "end_ms": 468190,
      "text": "庸俗的后现代"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 166,
      "start_ms": 468190,
      "end_ms": 469660,
      "text": "他就是不会做除法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 167,
      "start_ms": 469660,
      "end_ms": 470980,
      "text": "他没有看到这个玩意"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 168,
      "start_ms": 470980,
      "end_ms": 473650,
      "text": "1÷1削其实都没了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 169,
      "start_ms": 473650,
      "end_ms": 474460,
      "text": "一削就没了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 170,
      "start_ms": 474460,
      "end_ms": 477430,
      "text": "就很简单的一些东西就全都约掉了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 171,
      "start_ms": 477430,
      "end_ms": 478740,
      "text": "全约掉了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 172,
      "start_ms": 478940,
      "end_ms": 479780,
      "text": "全约掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 173,
      "start_ms": 479780,
      "end_ms": 482420,
      "text": "约到最后就会发现他们的公共公约数啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 174,
      "start_ms": 482420,
      "end_ms": 483560,
      "text": "就是这个内在性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 175,
      "start_ms": 483560,
      "end_ms": 486020,
      "text": "内在性其实也就是他的那个自我意识"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 176,
      "start_ms": 486020,
      "end_ms": 487940,
      "text": "自恋的那种自我形象在里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 177,
      "start_ms": 487940,
      "end_ms": 489860,
      "text": "他永远可以说里面还有啥"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 178,
      "start_ms": 489860,
      "end_ms": 491600,
      "text": "永远还有里面还有啥"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 179,
      "start_ms": 491600,
      "end_ms": 492920,
      "text": "看上去是一种自由"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 180,
      "start_ms": 492920,
      "end_ms": 495100,
      "text": "实际上是一种自我的束缚"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 181,
      "start_ms": 495100,
      "end_ms": 497980,
      "text": "实际上是一种自我折磨"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 182,
      "start_ms": 500100,
      "end_ms": 503420,
      "text": "实际上是一种自我阉割"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 183,
      "start_ms": 506699,
      "end_ms": 509299,
      "text": "这种阉割实际上就是个自我"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 184,
      "start_ms": 509299,
      "end_ms": 513099,
      "text": "永远永不面对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 185,
      "start_ms": 515179,
      "end_ms": 516970,
      "text": "内在性的真相"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 186,
      "start_ms": 516970,
      "end_ms": 521580,
      "text": "内在性的真相它永远不会面对它"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 187,
      "start_ms": 521580,
      "end_ms": 523890,
      "text": "这个内在性实际上是外部构造的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 188,
      "start_ms": 523890,
      "end_ms": 526950,
      "text": "它里面正每一层的这些具体的这些理论啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 189,
      "start_ms": 526950,
      "end_ms": 528459,
      "text": "这些什么张力啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 190,
      "start_ms": 528459,
      "end_ms": 529839,
      "text": "他之所以是有张力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 191,
      "start_ms": 529839,
      "end_ms": 531399,
      "text": "好像是道出了某些东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 192,
      "start_ms": 531399,
      "end_ms": 533679,
      "text": "并不是他的这一套玩也道出了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 193,
      "start_ms": 533679,
      "end_ms": 535119,
      "text": "而是指外面的这些东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 194,
      "start_ms": 535119,
      "end_ms": 536620,
      "text": "道出了某些真理"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 195,
      "start_ms": 536860,
      "end_ms": 538480,
      "text": "他自己的匮乏"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 196,
      "start_ms": 540580,
      "end_ms": 542280,
      "text": "自己的匮乏"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 197,
      "start_ms": 544620,
      "end_ms": 546020,
      "text": "馈字我老写错"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 198,
      "start_ms": 546020,
      "end_ms": 546800,
      "text": "愧妈的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 199,
      "start_ms": 546800,
      "end_ms": 547760,
      "text": "不是不写了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 200,
      "start_ms": 547760,
      "end_ms": 548500,
      "text": "匮乏"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 201,
      "start_ms": 549720,
      "end_ms": 551540,
      "text": "我这好多字都不会写了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 202,
      "start_ms": 551540,
      "end_ms": 553190,
      "text": "功亏一篑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 203,
      "start_ms": 553190,
      "end_ms": 554520,
      "text": "好像是一个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 204,
      "start_ms": 557200,
      "end_ms": 558060,
      "text": "匮乏吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 205,
      "start_ms": 558060,
      "end_ms": 560940,
      "text": "应该差不多这个样匮乏啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 206,
      "start_ms": 560940,
      "end_ms": 562140,
      "text": "他自己的匮乏"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 207,
      "start_ms": 563960,
      "end_ms": 569650,
      "text": "所以你能理解就是说这些玩意就是不愿意用"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 208,
      "start_ms": 569650,
      "end_ms": 570280,
      "text": "这种人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 209,
      "start_ms": 570280,
      "end_ms": 571720,
      "text": "就是不愿意用除法呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 210,
      "start_ms": 571720,
      "end_ms": 574400,
      "text": "他用除法一看神目如电"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 211,
      "start_ms": 574400,
      "end_ms": 575780,
      "text": "就看出了内在性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 212,
      "start_ms": 575780,
      "end_ms": 579360,
      "text": "内在性是这种庸俗的后现代主义的一个公约数"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 213,
      "start_ms": 579360,
      "end_ms": 580620,
      "text": "把这个公约数去掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 214,
      "start_ms": 580620,
      "end_ms": 583200,
      "text": "它才能突破的他那种病态的自恋"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 215,
      "start_ms": 583200,
      "end_ms": 586340,
      "text": "他才能从这种很低黑痛啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 216,
      "start_ms": 586340,
      "end_ms": 589580,
      "text": "这种这种这种自恋当中解脱出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 217,
      "start_ms": 589580,
      "end_ms": 592500,
      "text": "否则他永远就是无限镜像"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 218,
      "start_ms": 592500,
      "end_ms": 593460,
      "text": "无限自恋"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 219,
      "start_ms": 593460,
      "end_ms": 594219,
      "text": "镜像"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 220,
      "start_ms": 594840,
      "end_ms": 597080,
      "text": "无限自恋"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 221,
      "start_ms": 597080,
      "end_ms": 599180,
      "text": "自恋的镜像"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 222,
      "start_ms": 602540,
      "end_ms": 606760,
      "text": "他们实际上是一种符号学的一种癖好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 223,
      "start_ms": 606760,
      "end_ms": 607720,
      "text": "就喜欢两个字"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 224,
      "start_ms": 607720,
      "end_ms": 611110,
      "text": "不过啊这就是RA"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 225,
      "start_ms": 611110,
      "end_ms": 612760,
      "text": "不过是BB"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 226,
      "start_ms": 612760,
      "end_ms": 616640,
      "text": "不过是CC不过是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 227,
      "start_ms": 616640,
      "end_ms": 617630,
      "text": "不过是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 228,
      "start_ms": 617630,
      "end_ms": 619940,
      "text": "它本质主义只玩这一套"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 229,
      "start_ms": 619940,
      "end_ms": 622760,
      "text": "本质主义会说A不过是B啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 230,
      "start_ms": 622760,
      "end_ms": 624230,
      "text": "不过是B啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 231,
      "start_ms": 624230,
      "end_ms": 629710,
      "text": "然后A撇不过是BA撇撇不过是B"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 232,
      "start_ms": 629710,
      "end_ms": 632200,
      "text": "这个家伙比本质主义还恶心"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 233,
      "start_ms": 632200,
      "end_ms": 635980,
      "text": "这种庸俗的后现代主义它会比还恶心"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 234,
      "start_ms": 635980,
      "end_ms": 640200,
      "text": "他会说它会它不仅是AA撇"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 235,
      "start_ms": 640200,
      "end_ms": 641820,
      "text": "A撇撇A撇"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 236,
      "start_ms": 641820,
      "end_ms": 645900,
      "text": "撇撇到都到了这个B它是可以到C"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 237,
      "start_ms": 645900,
      "end_ms": 648910,
      "text": "可以到E可以到好多好多东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 238,
      "start_ms": 648910,
      "end_ms": 650680,
      "text": "他互相之间是个混乱的交叉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 239,
      "start_ms": 650680,
      "end_ms": 656620,
      "text": "他们最爽的就是连线这样本这种极庸俗的结构"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 240,
      "start_ms": 656620,
      "end_ms": 658150,
      "text": "主角庸俗的后现代主义者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 241,
      "start_ms": 658150,
      "end_ms": 662400,
      "text": "他们是他们享受的就是这种瞎逼连线的快感"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 242,
      "start_ms": 663100,
      "end_ms": 664020,
      "text": "无论如何"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 243,
      "start_ms": 664020,
      "end_ms": 665730,
      "text": "这个线总能连起来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 244,
      "start_ms": 665730,
      "end_ms": 666600,
      "text": "连不成"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 245,
      "start_ms": 666600,
      "end_ms": 668050,
      "text": "他就说里面有差异"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 246,
      "start_ms": 668050,
      "end_ms": 669010,
      "text": "连着城"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 247,
      "start_ms": 669010,
      "end_ms": 669670,
      "text": "他就说啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 248,
      "start_ms": 669670,
      "end_ms": 671260,
      "text": "你看我多聪明"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 249,
      "start_ms": 671260,
      "end_ms": 672400,
      "text": "好好好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 250,
      "start_ms": 672400,
      "end_ms": 673960,
      "text": "实际上他真的爽的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 251,
      "start_ms": 673960,
      "end_ms": 676000,
      "text": "就是无限往下突破表象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 252,
      "start_ms": 676000,
      "end_ms": 678959,
      "text": "不停往内里渗透的那种内在性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 253,
      "start_ms": 679080,
      "end_ms": 681570,
      "text": "那是他的公约数好了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 254,
      "start_ms": 681570,
      "end_ms": 683490,
      "text": "要克服这种后现代主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 255,
      "start_ms": 683490,
      "end_ms": 687869,
      "text": "就是要看到这种往内突破的这种内在性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 256,
      "start_ms": 687869,
      "end_ms": 692009,
      "text": "它实际上是外在于整个体系的这种内在性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 257,
      "start_ms": 692009,
      "end_ms": 699380,
      "text": "这种无条件的无条件内部化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 258,
      "start_ms": 700560,
      "end_ms": 708800,
      "text": "一个新的表象的真正根基"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 259,
      "start_ms": 712500,
      "end_ms": 713360,
      "text": "是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 260,
      "start_ms": 713360,
      "end_ms": 716060,
      "text": "是一个外在的外在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 261,
      "start_ms": 716060,
      "end_ms": 720760,
      "text": "这整个表象体系的悬在空中的服的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 262,
      "start_ms": 722700,
      "end_ms": 727500,
      "text": "自我阿基米德的阿基米德"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 263,
      "start_ms": 729920,
      "end_ms": 733540,
      "text": "所以所以这种后现代主义并不是真正意义上说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 264,
      "start_ms": 733540,
      "end_ms": 735040,
      "text": "看穿了这表象有多少层"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 265,
      "start_ms": 735040,
      "end_ms": 738380,
